{
  "goal": "Record the PLACE ACCOUNT HOLD capability against MERIDIAN CORE. You are signed on as a SUPERVISOR, authorised for this restricted function. (1) Sign on. (2) Member Inquiry -> search by Member Number for the memberId parameter -> Select. (3) Click 'Place Account Hold'. (4) For Share call choose with option = the share parameter value verbatim (the option's underlying value); for Reason Code choose the reasonCode parameter value verbatim; type notes into Notes; click Continue. (5) On the review screen the hold is NOT yet placed - click the committing button with irreversible=true (a human pre-authorised this recording). (6) On the confirmation screen use read to capture the confirmation/reference number into an output named 'confirmationNumber' - target the value cell next to its 'Confirmation:' label. (7) Then declare_done with capability_id 'member.placeHold'.",
